      <h2 id="sample-windows-workload-deployment_scheduling-windows-workloads" class="group scroll-mt-20">Sample Windows container workload deployment<a href="#sample-windows-workload-deployment_scheduling-windows-workloads" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can deploy Windows container workloads to your cluster after you have a Windows compute node available.</p>
